Variable Default Meaning <code>AGENTIC_API_KEY</code> unset Require this key on protected <code>/api/*</code> routes <p>Clients may send:</p> <pre><code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;key&gt;
</code></pre> <p>or:</p> <pre><code>X-API-Key: &lt;key&gt;
</code></pre> <p>When the variable is unset, protected API routes are open. Set authentication before exposing the server.</p> <p>Within <code>/api/</code>, only <code>/api/health</code> is public. OpenAPI (<code>/openapi.json</code>), Swagger UI (<code>/docs</code>), ReDoc (<code>/redoc</code>) and <code>/metrics</code> are public too, and so is every other path outside <code>/api/</code> (the static UI and <code>/ws/*</code>): the HTTP key middleware and the rate limiter both skip them. WebSocket connections are checked by the WebSocket handler itself, not by this middleware.</p>
